  "byline": null,
  "publishedAt": null,
  "contentHtml": "<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!w6Is!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5de5d442-0449-4f37-a82b-7e09457b3074_2756x748.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!w6Is!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5de5d442-0449-4f37-a82b-7e09457b3074_2756x748.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"395\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\n\n</a></figure>\n<p>In this space on Saturdays, I <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/t/roundup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">do a weekly round-up</a> of sorts: Sifting through what I wrote that you might have missed during the week, what I’ve been reading and watching myself, and some other fun things that have been going on.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/subscribe?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h4>📝 What I did this week</h4>\n<p><em>Here are the things I wrote or podcasted about during the previous week, sorted in descending order by quality, popularity and/or current relevance.</em></p>\n<p><strong>📊 My <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/t/updating-model\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Odds/Models</a>: <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-nfl-odds-tracker-and-elo-ratings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NFL </a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-mlb-elo-power-ratings-playoff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MLB </a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-wnba-elo-team-power-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">WNBA </a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-nba-elo-forecast-and-player\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NBA</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-nhl-team-elo-power-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NHL </a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-college-football-odds-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CFB</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-english-premier-league-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">EPL</a> | <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-nascar-cup-series-driver-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NASCAR</a></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>I <a href=\"https://substack.com/@neilpaine/note/c-345435119\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">messed up and ran TWO baseball stories</a> on Friday (one of which was supposed to go next week), so hopefully you enjoyed these!</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/the-phillies-won-the-2008-world-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Phillies Won the 2008 World Series. The Rays Won Baseball’s Future.</a></strong> - As Philadelphia and Tampa Bay meet to close out the regular season, I looked back at their 2008 World Series matchup 18 years later — when the Phillies won the championship, but the Rays helped lay the analytical groundwork for modern baseball.</p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/ichiro-and-the-2001-seattle-mariners-a0b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ichiro and the 2001 Seattle Mariners Were MLB’s Weirdest, Winningest Team</a></strong> - With 25 years having passed since Seattle’s historic 116-win season, I looked back at the magical <a href=\"https://www.baseball-reference.com/teams/SEA/2001.shtml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2001 Mariners</a> and Ichiro Suzuki’s legendary rookie year, and how one of baseball’s strangest rosters wound up dominating the sport one summer.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/the-market-believes-in-the-dodgers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Market Believes In the Dodgers. Not So Much the Brewers, Rays, White Sox and Cubs.</a></strong> - Milwaukee may have MLB’s <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-mlb-elo-power-ratings-playoff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">best record and top Elo rating</a> in 2026, but the <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/190966113/2026-mlb-team-aggregated-market-forecast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">markets</a> and other predictive metrics still see the two-time defending champion Dodgers as the team to beat — and remain deeply skeptical around most of the rest of the field.</p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/does-baseball-still-need-divisions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Does Baseball Still Need Divisions To Matter This Much?</a></strong> - With the AL Central and (especially) AL West winners <a href=\"https://substack.com/@neilpaine/note/c-344719271\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">headed for historically low win totals</a>, I looked at whether MLB’s balanced schedule and expanded playoff format have made it impossible to justify giving division champions first-round byes and preferential seeds.</p></li>\n<li><p>🏒 <strong><a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nhl/story/_/id/50007145/nhl-2026-27-stanley-cup-playoffs-champions-contenders-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Stanley Cup Contender Tiers: Where Do All 32 NHL Teams Fit In?</a></strong> - With the new season approaching, I sorted all 32 NHL teams into contender tiers, from those with the clearest paths to the Stanley Cup to the dark-horses, and beyond.</p></li>\n<li><p>🏈 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/who-needs-a-starting-qb-not-seattle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Who Needs a Starting QB? Not Seattle or Minnesota.</a></strong> - With backup quarterbacks Drew Lock and Carson Wentz leading their teams to 2-0 starts, the Seahawks and Vikings are showing how a great defense and strong supporting cast can insulate a team from losing when there’s trouble at the game’s most important position.</p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/howie-roses-iconic-career-is-going\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Howie Rose’s Iconic Career Is Going in the Books</a></strong> - As beloved New York Mets radio voice Howie Rose broadcast his final game last weekend, I looked back at his remarkable career — and at the broader changing-of-the-guard that has reshaped local MLB booths over the past decade.</p></li>\n<li>\n<p>🏁 <strong><a href=\"https://www.nascar.com/news-media/2026/09/24/analysis-why-three-straight-intermediates-could-define-championship-battle/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Why Three Straight Intermediates Could Define the Championship Battle</a></strong> - At  this week, I looked at why three consecutive races on 1.5-mile intermediate tracks could decide the Cup Series title fight, with some contenders clearly standing out more on these bread-and-butter tracks than others.</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!R937!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4bd57bb-d63f-47d9-89eb-fdf87592bad3_2400x2580.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!R937!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4bd57bb-d63f-47d9-89eb-fdf87592bad3_2400x2580.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1565\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\n\n</a></figure>\n<ul><li><p>🏁🎙️ <strong><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/73dkAcdgJMo9oq846i4V08?si=8V98oM30QiW1pVgJt8t_kQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Podracing: Bristol Fight Race</a></strong> - In this week’s , <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tyler-lauletta-b0399667/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Lauletta</a> and I talked about — what else! — the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zucbKmYLL4Y\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">post-race melee between Ryan Blaney and Carson Hocevar</a> at Bristol. But there was a lot else to unpack, from Joey Logano’s win to the state of the Chase as we head into the intermediate section of the schedule:</p></li></ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>📊 Charts of the week:</h4>\n<p>Here were some of my favorite viz items of the week from <em><strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/scoreboard-newsletter-archives\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Scoreboard</a></strong></em>, my daily newsletter for <a href=\"https://sherwood.news/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sherwood News</a>… </p>\n<p><strong>🏈</strong><em><strong> On the <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/217249357/find-the-edge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">whiplash in NFL team performance</a> from Week 1-2…</strong></em></p>\n<div></div>\n<p>⚽<strong> </strong><em><strong>On how <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/fixture-friction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">rest days change soccer teams’ lineups</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"reader-datawrapper\"><a href=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/7Rfgv/1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/139e01b2-41fc-4387-b607-a92aa6778cd7_1220x664.png\" alt=\"Less rest = more squad rotation\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><p>Less rest = more squad rotation</p></div>\n<p>🏒<strong> </strong><em><strong>On <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/216918271/chart-of-the-day\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NFL teams’ sudden QB crunch</a> to start the ‘26 season…</strong></em></p>\n<p><strong>🏀</strong><em><strong> On <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/216764314/chart-of-the-day\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">falling WNBA records</a> this season…</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"reader-datawrapper\"><a href=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/Dlmuk/3/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/d28c5ead-96e1-4235-85c2-cbad4fce4695_1220x790.png\" alt=\"Watch out for falling records!\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><p>Watch out for falling records!</p></div>\n<p><em>Subscribe to <strong>Scoreboard</strong> by <strong><a href=\"https://join.sherwood.news/scoreboard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">clicking here</a></strong>!</em></p>\n<h4>👀 Some interesting things I read/watched this week</h4>\n<p><em>A collection of articles (with a heavy focus on my fellow Substackers), videos and other media that I enjoyed and/or found thought-provoking over the past week. I don’t always 100% agree with or endorse what’s linked here… but that’s also sort of the point.</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><strong>🏈<a href=\"https://frontporchsports.substack.com/p/is-it-time-to-rein-in-buy-games-in?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1460693&amp;post_id=217347443&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> “Is it time to rein in buy games in college football?” </a></strong>by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>🏈 <a href=\"https://www.capandtrade.football/p/3-keys-to-winning-an-nfl-game?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=710863&amp;post_id=217090320&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“3 Keys to Winning an NFL Game”</a> </strong>by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>🏈 <a href=\"https://www.throwthedamball.com/p/is-herbert-washed?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=255229&amp;post_id=217159449&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“Is Herbert Washed?”</a></strong> by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>🏈 <a href=\"https://bfarrell27.substack.com/p/cfb-teams-that-are-just-really-neat?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=459537&amp;post_id=216815811&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“CFB teams that are just really fun”</a> </strong>by  </p></li>\n<li><p>🏈<strong> <a href=\"https://thespade.substack.com/p/do-nfl-teams-beat-the-heat?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1892935&amp;post_id=216731310&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“Do NFL Teams Beat the Heat?”</a></strong> by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>🏈 <a href=\"https://samhoppen.substack.com/p/hoppen-to-conclusions-week-3-nfl-fbb?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=3318239&amp;post_id=216728422&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“Hoppen to Conclusions Week 3: NFL Trends &amp; Performance”</a></strong> by  </p></li>\n<li><p>🏈 <strong><a href=\"https://throwbacks.substack.com/p/ernie-accorsi-19412026-and-the-making?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=31587&amp;post_id=216925608&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=false&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“Ernie Accorsi (1941–2026) and the Making of the Modern NFL”</a></strong> and <strong><a href=\"https://throwbacks.substack.com/p/the-reaction-what-happens-if-the?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=31587&amp;post_id=216028685&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=false&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“What Happens If the Cleveland Browns...Actually Start Winning?”</a> </strong>by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>🏈 <a href=\"https://greggeasterbrook.substack.com/p/tmq-josh-allen-stat-machine?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1434457&amp;post_id=216813565&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=false&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“TMQ: Josh Allen, Stat Machine”</a></strong> by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>🏈 <a href=\"https://www.matchquarters.com/p/flores-base-pressure-run-defense?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=58626&amp;post_id=216021942&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“How Brian Flores Uses Pressure to Kill the Run”</a> </strong>by  </p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://ritmica1.substack.com/p/ayami-sato-is-baseball-at-its-most?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=5688290&amp;post_id=217252002&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“Ayami Sato Is Baseball at Its Most Enjoyable”</a></strong> by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>⚾ <a href=\"https://uniwatch.substack.com/p/the-rays-just-set-a-uniform-related?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=10041743&amp;post_id=217010430&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“The Rays Just Set a Uniform-Related Record”</a></strong>